cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this observatory, its data or code, please cite it as below."
title: "Digital Infrastructure & Resource Governance Observatory: Mexico, 2020–2027"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-04
authors:
  - family-names: "Aranda Medrano"
    given-names: "Laura Pamela"
license: MIT
keywords: [digital infrastructure, data centres, water governance, energy, Mexico, composite indicators, uncertainty]
abstract: >-
  A reproducible research instrument that describes and models relationships among digital
  infrastructure, water pressure, energy systems and resource governance in Mexico's 32 states,
  with explicit epistemic status, coverage scores and sensitivity analysis for every value.
  It does not by itself establish causal relationships, legal violations or corporate responsibility.
